preConditionHook:
// EVIDENCE OF DIRECTIONAL PRESSURE AT THIS LEVEL WITHIN THE LAST N BARS:
// either at least minPressureBars bars carried a prominent tail on the relevant
// side, OR at least minPressureBars bars carried a strong same-direction body.
//
// This is UpperTailCountInWindow OR StrongBodyBarCountInWindow, each at its own
// threshold. Both parts are carried separately in the catalog, and normally a
// composite would be dropped in favour of its parts -- but the entry panes AND,
// so an OR cannot be composed, and the rule is carried whole for that reason
// alone.
//
// ORIENTATION, matching UpperTailCountInWindow and GrowingTopTails: the LONG
// side counts UPPER tails and BEAR bodies, which is the BEARISH reading of the
// window. A with-trend long filter therefore NEGATES the placement; a
// reversal-long filter takes it as written.
//
// Not TailBarCountDominance, which COMPARES the two tail counts against each
// other over one threshold; this counts two DIFFERENT classifications against
// two thresholds and ORs them.
//
// EL: four CountIF calls over pressureLookback. CountIF counts bars 0..N-1
// INCLUDING the current bar and its argument is a true SERIES (EL_FEATURES
// `countif`, VERIFIED): every price term shifts with the counted bar, which is
// what this loop does. The counted terms are prices with real history, so no
// zero-filled variable mirror is needed. The counts are EL numeric variables,
// kept as doubles.
//
// MaxList / MinList select among open and close -- tick-grid PRICE operands,
// the scope their ACCEPTED row allows -- so plain > / < stand in, exactly as
// UpperTailCountInWindow writes the same selection.
//
// Products, not quotients: EasyLanguage raises a runtime divide-by-zero and a
// zero-range bar is legal data. The counts and selections are class members and
// persist across bars, so they are reset or reassigned before use.
//
// Deepest bar touched: pressureLookback - 1.
upperTailBars = 0.0;
lowerTailBars = 0.0;
bearBodyBars = 0.0;
bullBodyBars = 0.0;
for (int i = 0; i < (int)pressureLookback; ++i) {
    bodyTop = open[i];
    if (close[i] > bodyTop) bodyTop = close[i];
    bodyBottom = open[i];
    if (close[i] < bodyBottom) bodyBottom = close[i];
    if (el_ge(high[i] - bodyTop, minTailFraction * (high[i] - low[i]))) {
        upperTailBars = upperTailBars + 1;
    }
    if (el_ge(bodyBottom - low[i], minTailFraction * (high[i] - low[i]))) {
        lowerTailBars = lowerTailBars + 1;
    }
    if (el_lt(close[i], open[i]) && el_ge(open[i] - close[i], minBodyFraction * (high[i] - low[i]))) {
        bearBodyBars = bearBodyBars + 1;
    }
    if (el_gt(close[i], open[i]) && el_ge(close[i] - open[i], minBodyFraction * (high[i] - low[i]))) {
        bullBodyBars = bullBodyBars + 1;
    }
}
